          "qualifiedTypeId": "game.core.world.location",
          "value": {
            "kind": "site",
            "summary": "Location: Peat country west of Whitewindow's surface road. Livelihood: Limited peat cutting, grazing, and guide work. The listening ring lies in a protected patch within working land. Its stones were reset after later disturbance, and only part of the original effect persists. Visitors often hear nothing. Local families maintain paths because losing someone in the moss is a greater concern than disappointing a scholar.",
